{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120088","id":3825522578,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7kBNeS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120088","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120088.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120088.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120088","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120088/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120088/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120088/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e43dffa0984067928a94fbfac90b1351183e55ca","number":120088,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement GPU mappable buffers.","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nMany UMA devices do not expose a separate transfer queue. This means transfer workers cannot overlap their work with the previous frame and can only execute after rendering has finished. As a result, the cost is paid by the current frame.\r\n\r\nIn this PR, buffers are created as both GPU visible and CPU visible on UMA devices, and data is copied directly to the mapped memory pointer. This allows us to skip transfer workers entirely while also overlapping the operation with the previous frame.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nBuffers are created with the `GPU_MAPPABLE` allocation type only when initial data is provided, since that's the only time transfer workers are used for buffers. Copies performed after creation always run on the main graphics queue, so this PR has no effect on those cases.\r\n\r\nI also added support for discrete GPUs with ReBAR to use this path. However, since writes over the PCIe bus can be expensive, the path is only taken when creation occurs outside the render thread. UMA devices can always use this path because copying has no extra cost.\r\n\r\n## Example\r\n\r\nUsing the following script, which creates 1000 array meshes every frame in a GPU bound scene to exaggerate the problem:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\nfunc _process(_delta):\r\n\tfor i in 1000:\r\n\t\tvar arrays := []\r\n\t\tarrays.resize(Mesh.ARRAY_MAX)\r\n\r\n\t\tarrays[Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX] = PackedVector3Array([\r\n\t\t\tVector3(0, 0, 0),\r\n\t\t\tVector3(0, 0, 0),\r\n\t\t\tVector3(0, 0, 0)\r\n\t\t])\r\n\r\n\t\tvar mesh := ArrayMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.add_surface_from_arrays(\r\n\t\t\tMesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES,\r\n\t\t\tarrays\r\n\t\t)\r\n```\r\n\r\nFrame times on an Adreno 830:\r\n\r\n* Before: 65 FPS (15.3 mspf)\r\n* After: 120 FPS (8.3 mspf)\r\n\r\nTextures could also benefit from this, but Vulkan only supports it through the `VK_EXT_host_image_copy` extension which doesn't seem widely supported, so I haven't attempted it yet. It's pretty easy on D3D12 in comparison.\r\n\r\n~Also need to check Metal.~ Metal is now done.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/eve